              "text": "The URL **`www.home.fedex.com/express`** (often referred to simply as `home.fedex.com`) is the official **internal employee intranet portal** (FedEx Home) specifically for the **FedEx Express** division. \n\n### 1. Network Requirements (Why it might not load)\nThis website is hosted behind the secure FedEx corporate firewall. **It cannot be accessed over the public internet.**\n* **How to open it:** You must be physically on-site at a FedEx facility or station and using a company-authorized computer/workstation (or a secure corporate VPN). \n* **At-home error:** If you attempt to open this URL on your home computer or personal phone, it will result in a \"403 Forbidden\", a connection timeout, or a \"site cannot be reached\" error.\n\n### 2. What is the portal used for?\nOnce you are on the FedEx network, logging into `home.fedex.com` allows you to search for internal resources and keywords to access:\n* **Dimensions (Kronos):** To check schedules, view worked hours, and submit timecards.\n* **Internal Job Postings:** Applying for internal career moves and promotions.\n* **Travel and Employee Discounts:** Accessing TravelNet, airline personal travel benefits (like ID90/ID75), and rental car or hotel corporate codes.\n* **HR Online and Policies:** Looking up employee manuals, benefit handbooks, and code of conduct guidelines.\n\n### 3. How to access your info from home\nIf you are off-site and need to access your employee account, pay stubs, or schedules, you must use public-facing FedEx portals instead:\n* **FedEx MyApps (Okta Portal):** Go to [purpleid.okta.com](https://purpleid.okta.com) or [myapps.secure.fedex.com](https://myapps.secure.fedex.com) and log in using your FedEx PurpleID and password (requires setting up Okta 2-factor authentication).\n* **My Payroll / Employee Self Service (ESS):** You can view pay stubs and tax documents (W-2s) from home. Express and Freight employees can log into the **iFedEx HR portal**, while Ground employees can access these documents via **Workday**.\n* **Workday App:** Download the Workday app on your mobile device and log in with your employee credentials to view schedules, request time off, or look at your employee profile.",
